{
  "result": "That's a big one to only get one wish for.\n\nIf I could change just one thing, I think I'd make it so no one has to go through the hard stuff alone \u2014 not hunger, not illness, not the feeling of being invisible or unheard.\n\nNot in a big, top-down way where I'd decide how everyone should live. More like a floor everyone can stand on: if you're suffering in a way that could be prevented or eased, someone notices, and help actually reaches you. In real life, a lot of misery isn't inevitable, it's just... overlooked. People fall through cracks, or quietly carry things they shouldn't have to carry by themselves.\n\nI think if that changed, a lot else would follow naturally. People who feel secure and seen tend to be kinder, more curious, more able to think beyond just getting through the day.\n\nWhat about you \u2014 if you had one change, would you go for something big and sweeping, or something smaller that ripples out?",
